ang galing kasi niyang magboxing.

298
00:13:50.963 --> 00:13:51.964
-Sa unang round.
-Oo.

299
00:13:52.031 --> 00:13:54.567
Pareho silang magaling. mahal ko ito.

300
00:13:56.102 --> 00:13:57.370
[announcer] Pulang sulok,

301
00:13:57.437 --> 00:13:59.906
Kim Hunsu at Lee Juyeong.

