00:14:17.557 --> 00:14:19.425
Magiging masaya ito.

311
00:14:19.926 --> 00:14:22.562
-Ang laban na ito ay may totoong kwento sa likod nito.
-[Dex] Tama.

312
00:14:23.129 --> 00:14:26.165
[Juyeong] Nakita si Kim Minwoo

313
00:14:26.733 --> 00:14:28.034
