Tingnan natin kung paano ito gumaganap.

326
00:15:02.635 --> 00:15:05.204
[announcer] Mga unang mandirigma,

327
00:15:05.271 --> 00:15:06.272
pumasok.

328
00:15:08.174 --> 00:15:09.575
Ang mas mabibigat na lalaki ay nauna.

329
00:15:09.642 --> 00:15:11.110
RED CORNER R1 KIM HUNSU

330
00:15:12.245 --> 00:15:13.346
BLUE CORNER R1 LEE GIJUN

331
00:15:13.413 --> 00:15:15.281
