340
00:15:33.466 --> 00:15:35.635
[contestant 4] Lalaki, matangkad talaga siya.

341
00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.571
[contestant 5] Na abot, bagaman.

342
00:15:39.138 --> 00:15:41.073
