395
00:17:50.136 --> 00:17:51.504
Gijun, bumangon ka at huminga!

396
00:17:53.072 --> 00:17:54.206
[contestant 2] Pindutin mo siya!

397
00:17:54.774 --> 00:17:56.108
-Hundin mo siya!
-[contestant 3] Magaling!

398
00:17:56.175 --> 00:17:58.177
[nagbubulalas ang mga kalahok]

399
00:17:59.712 --> 00:18:01.147
Ang ganda, Juyeong!

400
00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:04.150
Ang ganda, Juyeong!

401
00:18:07.219 --> 00:18:08.688
Nakakaloka ang mga kuha na iyon.

402
00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:10.389
Hindi siya napapagod.

403
00:18:10.456 --> 00:18:12.291
[contestant 2] Gijun, pasok ka diyan!

404
00:18:12.358 --> 00:18:13.459
